---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Shield, Cpu, Lock, Zap, Server, Globe, CheckCircle2, ShieldCheck, ArrowRight } from 'lucide-react';
---

<Layout
  title="Architecture & Philosophy - NovaTools"
  description="Learn about NovaTools, our mission to eliminate privacy risks in online file conversions, and our client-side local runtime."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10">
    {/* Page Header */}
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-100 dark:bg-[#16171a] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono text-slate-700 dark:text-[#d1d5db]">
        <Shield class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400" />
        <span>Local-First Engineering Architecture</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        High-Performance Media & Document Runtime
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-[#9ca3af] max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Confidential financial records, medical records, private photos, and proprietary video footage should never travel across remote servers simply to be converted or compressed.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Comparison: Cloud Problem vs Local Solution */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#1e2025] p-6 space-y-3 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/40 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-900/40">
          <Server class="h-4 w-4" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">The Cloud Converter Problem</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-[#9ca3af] leading-relaxed">
          Traditional web converters upload private documents to remote cloud infrastructure. 
          Even with deletion promises, files transit public networks, sit in unverified storage buckets, and risk exposure to interception.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#1e2025] p-6 space-y-3 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/40">
          <Cpu class="h-4 w-4" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">The Client-Side Solution</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-[#9ca3af] leading-relaxed">
          NovaTools executes 100% of its workloads directly inside your browser sandbox. 
          By utilizing compiled in-browser engines, WebCodecs, and Web Audio DSP, your device processes files at native speed with zero data leakage.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Technical Core Pillars */}
    <section class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#1e2025] p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6 shadow-sm">
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.06] pb-3">
        <h2 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          Core Architectural Pillars
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#16171a] p-4 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.06]">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/40 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/40 mt-0.5">
            <Lock class="h-4 w-4" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Zero Server Transmission</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-[#9ca3af] mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              When you load a file into NovaTools, it is held in typed ArrayBuffers in local memory. No binary file payload ever leaves your device or touches an external server.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#16171a] p-4 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.06]">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/40 mt-0.5">
            <Zap class="h-4 w-4" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Direct Hardware Acceleration</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-[#9ca3af] mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Zero network queues or server-side throttling. Transcoding and calculations occur across client CPU and GPU cores in parallel.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#16171a] p-4 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.06]">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-[#1e2025] text-slate-700 dark:text-[#d1d5db] border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] mt-0.5">
            <Globe class="h-4 w-4" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Offline Capable & Sovereign</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-[#9ca3af] mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Because workloads execute locally, tools function even in restricted environments, on airplanes, or in air-gapped workstations.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Contact CTA */}
    <div class="pt-2 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-[#9ca3af] font-mono flex items-center justify-between">
      <span>Questions or architectural inquiries?</span>
      <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold">
        Contact Engineering <ArrowRight class="h-3 w-3" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
